      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Autotransfusion of blood exposed to UV irradiation proved highly effective in multimodality rehabilitation treatment of coronary patients with the disease functional classes II and III. Short-term and long-term results indicate a positive effect on hyperlipoproteinemia, hyperglycosuria, hemodynamics, exercise tolerance. The method is recommended for use in sanatoria and outpatient clinics."},
